  Toggle Command Log
  Toggle showing or hiding the command log
  Toggle Workflows
  Toggle showing or hiding repo actions
  Toggle Issues
  Toggle showing or hiding repo issues
  Toggle Pull Requests
  Toggle showing or hiding repo pull requests
